<title>USA: Foodquest extends warrants.</title>
<headline>Foodquest extends warrants.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foodquest Inc said Monday that it was extending the expiration date of its public warrants to November 11, 1998.</p>
<p>In addition, the company said warrants held by Roasters Corp were extended for one year to November 11, 1997.</p>
